      _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_2__["ɵɵelementStart"](236, "p");
      _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_2__["ɵɵtext"](237, " My professional journey began with Coforge, after graduation in August 2021. Here I've experienced a workplace that truly supports early career professionals with an environment of continuous learning & growth. Stepping into the world of HR helped me discover a true sense of purpose in supporting people & connecting the right talent with the right opportunities. It was especially important for me to work with an organization where English communication was an integral part of everyday interactions, and I am thankful that Coforge has given me the space to develop and strengthen this skill. I am truly grateful for the support and trust of my manager and the leadership team, whose guidance has been instrumental in my early professional growth. I also appreciate my colleagues for fostering a positive, collaborative, and enriching work environment that inspires me every day. ");
