      _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_2__["ɵɵtext"](253, " I joined Coforge over 5 years ago as a Systems Analyst. The organization has consistently provided me with meaningful and challenging opportunities that have helped me expand my skills, demonstrate my capabilities, and showcase my potential. The trust and encouragement I receive here continue to motivate me to grow my career within the organization. I\u2019m fortunate to work with supportive colleagues from multiple nationalities, who collaborate closely and maintain a strong bond even outside of work. The culture encourages open sharing of ideas and solutions without bias, and I truly value the experience of working with teams across the globe. ");
