      _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_2__["ɵɵtext"](269, " Coforge has given me a place to learn, grow, and take on meaningful work, truly shaping my business acumen and strengthening my sense of ownership. As I look to complete almost a decade with Coforge, the defining part of my journey has been leading large scale delivery operations in my business. Being in a management role has allowed me to drive initiatives that make a real difference and grow as a leader. The projects I have led here have strengthened how I work, lead teams, and approach problem solving. Looking back, the exposure I\u2019ve gained has been both rewarding and enriching. Whether it\u2019s handling complex challenges, driving customer success, or planning for the long term, I am glad to be part of a team that makes me feel seen, supported, and genuinely valued. ");
