      _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_2__["ɵɵelementStart"](284, "p");
      _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_2__["ɵɵtext"](285, " I began my journey with Coforge during the pandemic and observed the strong support consistently provided to employees. It was clear from day one that employees are truly valued here, with everyone feeling equipped, aligned, and encouraged to succeed. The opportunities I have received have been pivotal to my career - two promotions, diverse projects, and constant guidance from leadership. Even in challenging situations, I have received the support needed to deliver successful outcomes. I joined in 2021 as an Associate Team Member and now support the training team as a Senior Team Leader. I\u2019m truly proud of how far I\u2019ve come with Coforge. ");
