      _angular_core__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_2__["ɵɵtext"](301, " I started my career in 2000 with an organization that was later acquired by Coforge. Since then, Coforge has been a significant part of my professional journey. I chose to stay and continue, because I strongly believed in its strategic vision and long\u2011term direction of the organization. What motivates me every day is the culture of respect, collaboration, innovation, and continuous learning. My visits to India and interactions with the diverse teams have strengthened this sense of belonging. I have handled multiple roles over the years and am proud to contribute to an organization that and aligns so closely with my values. ");
